<section class="on-paper angled angled-gold">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy rv">
      <p>Team 6220 started in 2016 as a small group of Los Alamitos High School students working out of the Build-It Workspace. That first season we won the Orange County Regional and went to the World Championship.</p>
      <p>After COVID we rebuilt from about a dozen students, and since then we have rewritten our design process, training, and team structure.</p>
      <blockquote class="philosophy"><p class="eyebrow">Student-led, student-driven</p><p>Our team is unique because of the immense focus we place on implementing our “student-led, student-driven” philosophy into everything we do. Our experienced mentors, mostly current or retired engineers, provide critical professional knowledge, safety experience, and legal responsibilities, but our students make nearly every final decision for our robot and the team.</p><p>As a result, our team enables students to gain vast amounts of hands-on experience not only in technical skills, but also in teamwork, leadership, and resourceful problem solving.</p></blockquote>
      <ul class="chips" aria-label="Skills we learn"><li>CAD</li><li>Machining</li><li>Electrical</li><li>Java / WPILib</li><li>Strategy &amp; scouting</li><li>Business &amp; outreach</li><li>Media</li></ul>
      <div class="frc-note">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">What is FRC?</p>
        <p>The FIRST Robotics Competition is an international high school league. Each January a new game is revealed, and teams design and build a robot to play it in a few short months. Teams compete hard, then help each other in the pits: FIRST calls it Gracious Professionalism.</p>
        <a class="sweep" href="https://www.firstinspires.org/robotics/frc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more at FIRST ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="has-dots rv" style="--d:1"><svg class="deco dots dots-about" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#dotk)"/></svg><figure class="photo-frame photo-card" style="margin:0"><div class="pc-in"><img src={media("team/2d048fe84f.webp")} alt="Team 6220 members in gold and black team shirts smiling up at the camera in the pits" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div>
  </div>
</section>
